Homepage: https://github.com/footprintsntrails/whisper-browser
Description: quiet browser built on Firefox
 Whisper starts your installed Firefox with a separate, quiet profile:
 telemetry and studies off, uBlock Origin from addons.mozilla.org,
 DNS over HTTPS, Strict tracking protection and a dark theme with tabs
 on the side. Your normal Firefox profile is not touched.
 .
 Whisper can't make you invisible. It just won't snitch.
